  "description": "Stripped of her crown and locked in an underground cell after a bloody revolution, Princess Lien believed her life was over. Three years later, she is pulled from the dark and forced into an arranged marriage with the powerful Duke Lishian of Roche-Noir. Haunted by the stigmas of her fallen past, Lien retreats into a shell of trauma. Yet, through Lishian’s unwavering devotion and quiet warmth, she discovers that love and trust are far stronger than fate. \n\nA breathtaking story of healing, political intrigue, and finding home in each other's arms.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=854367), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14653825)",
